  "summary_en": "UK CDEI report summarising industry barriers and enablers to AI assurance, drawing on roundtables, a symposium, interviews and a 41-respondent survey. It covers cross-sector findings and HR/recruitment, finance and connected and automated vehicles, and identifies skills, standards and regulatory uncertainty barriers and possible interventions.",
