   "Industry supports proportionate, risk-based assurance within wider risk management.",
   "Participants want third-party certification or accreditation of assurance providers.",
   "Barriers include skills gaps, weak senior buy-in, complex standards and regulatory uncertainty.",
   "Impact assessments are the most commonly used assurance technique.",
   "Regulatory compliance (UK GDPR, EU AI Act) and competitive advantage drive assurance uptake."
